    "detailed_description": "Mix the elements from your magical dice to create powerful spells and fight your way through enemies to reclaim the castle from demons and win the princesses hand in marriage \u2764\ufe0f <br><br>Wildmagic Wizardry is a Spell Mixing, Dice Rolling, Strategy rogue like. Collect unique items and elemental gems to increase your power as you progress through the game. Making each run unique as you find a playstyle most fun for you!<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Turn based grid combat<br></li><li> Collect new dice to create new spells<br></li><li> Earn powerful rewards to drastically increase your combat abilities<br></li><li> Use your enemy codex to carefully plan each turn and outmaneuver your opponents<br></li><li> New map and encounters generated each time - never have two runs the same</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Mix the elements from your magical dice to create powerful spells and fight your way through enemies to reclaim the castle from demons and win the princesses hand in marriage \u2764\ufe0f <br><br>Wildmagic Wizardry is a Spell Mixing, Dice Rolling, Strategy rogue like. Collect unique items and elemental gems to increase your power as you progress through the game. Making each run unique as you find a playstyle most fun for you!<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Turn based grid combat<br></li><li> Collect new dice to create new spells<br></li><li> Earn powerful rewards to drastically increase your combat abilities<br></li><li> Use your enemy codex to carefully plan each turn and outmaneuver your opponents<br></li><li> New map and encounters generated each time - never have two runs the same</li></ul>",
